# I04.var05 v1.0.2 recovery design — GO_CONTRACT_DESIGN_ONLY

Decision: **GO_CONTRACT_DESIGN_ONLY** for constructing a new v1.0.2 package. This decision does not approve canonical source writes, an actual SSH preflight, or native execution.

The reviewed design is `tmp/i04-var05-prospective-recovery-v102-revision2-20261008.json`, 922,508 bytes/SHA-256 `2353d18f907803c9023089e70202e7381cad266a0b8c7795bf98586ee067f292`. Its parent, manual, physical, source, roundtrip, complete log, full report, and scope sections are recursively type-exact with the frozen v1.0.1 recovery contract. It preserves the two-cell child source delta, four predeclared log forms, 4,044 report cells and exactly three paired differences. The new package is `I04-var05-zero-transport-between-v1.0.2`, logical run ID `i04-var05-zero-transport-between-v102-ssh-20261008-01`, and distinct absent physical path `repo/tmp/native-runs/i04v05-v102-20261008-01`. Its complete prospective converter `File: model.sxi` line is exactly 121 ASCII bytes, below the declared 199-byte bound. Exact full Input/Output/File paths and 0/2/0 diagnostics remain required after calc and before report.

The design preserves the excluded v1.0.1 failure: original 172-row inventory and 1,980-role manifest with exact pinned source bytes, original failed PURE preflight receipt/stdout/stderr, 21 PURE originals, 18 root/copier originals, and the frozen independent NO_GO memo. These are mandatory before preflight and sealed replay. V1.0.1 had zero native attempts and zero actual SSH preflights. The first unreviewed v102 draft and its generator proof remain pinned as construction history; the revision2 design repairs its descriptive parent label and stale version prose without changing behavior or source oracles.

Independent auditor `tmp/i04-var05-independent-recovery-contract-audit-v102-revision2-20261008.py` is 6,065 bytes/SHA-256 `3d423ce7f7cdd480b9c0825d7df9000000d90039b87c3fc67e690e04a95a33aa`. Root captured its actual integer exit 0, empty original stderr, stable method hash and no native calls in `tmp/i04-var05-independent-recovery-contract-proof-v102-revision2-20261008-01/receipt.json`, 946 bytes/SHA-256 `b4d84dccede2cfa086a841b9639e5fc3028000d6ade3482e88ad42bc4a16bf70`.

## Required next gates

1. Author and independent reviewer must agree on the **exact ordered** closed REVIEW filenames before any method freeze. The prospective contract puts the static memo third, followed by preserved drafts. Every further draft filename must be declared before the method GO.
2. The v1.0.2 standalone independent reader must expose `--pure-inventory-candidate EXTERNAL_JSON` and `--pure-manifest-candidate EXTERNAL_JSON` modes that call its actual final predicates on saved candidate bytes. Root must capture original streams and receive separate exact-candidate GO for the entire ordered source inventory **before** the one-time inventory write. The manifest candidate must be generated from that exact approved inventory, independently checked in full, captured and approved **before** its one-time write. Set equality alone is insufficient.
3. After canonical freeze, the same reader must pass fresh original-stream PURE preflight on unchanged source/manifest bytes. An actual zero-native SSH5 `-File -PreflightOnly` receipt then needs independent fresh GO_PRELAUNCH before one guarded native attempt. The WTS session was disconnected at design review; runtime remains held until a fresh structured Active state, protected GUI identity, mutex, ownership and run-absence guard pass.

The v1.0.1 package, its failed preflight and all frozen originals remain untouched. Construction may create only the new v1.0.2 package and reviewer-owned methods under their separate ownership boundaries.
